{"book":"genesis","lang":"en2","model":"glm-5.3","timestamp":"2026-08-29T21:17:10.079716472Z","verse":38,"ref":"genesis 31:38","tier":"glm-5.2","chapter":31,"translation":"These twenty years ⟨have⟩ I ⟨been⟩ with you; your ewes and your she-goats have not miscarried, and the rams of your flock I have not eaten.","tokens":[{"surface":"זה","gloss":"This"},{"surface":"עשרים","gloss":"twenty"},{"surface":"שנה","gloss":"years"},{"surface":"אנכי","gloss":"I"},{"surface":"עמך","gloss":"with you"},{"surface":"רחליך","gloss":"your ewes"},{"surface":"ועזיך","gloss":"and your she-goats"},{"surface":"לא","gloss":"not"},{"surface":"שכלו","gloss":"have miscarried"},{"surface":"ואילי","gloss":"and the rams"},{"surface":"צאנך","gloss":"of your flock"},{"surface":"לא","gloss":"not"},{"surface":"אכלתי","gloss":"I have eaten"}]}